            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Thanks for the issue!\n\nI can reproduce. The problem here is that built-in completion in (Neo)Vim usually actually inserts the completed word when navigating through completion items. So by the time the snippet candidate is selected, the buffer text before cursor is usually changed and adjusting for `textEdit` after the cursor is not trivial.\n\nThere seems to be an attempt of doing something similar specifically for snippets, but it is cumbersome. I'll take a look.",
