            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "This should now work on latest `main`. 'mini.completion' now saves the state of the initial prefix and artificially reproduces it if snippet item contains `textEdit` (to have it properly replace the region in the state close for which the `textEdit` was initially computed). I've tested with the `markdown-oxide` on described use case and it seems to work as expected.",
